  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KG3zJMU.png\" width=\"1128\" height=\"1904\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MBQksdy.png\" alt=\"生命与死亡更新\" width=\"1864\" height=\"2693\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>随着Minecraft 1.20“足迹与故事”更新引入了考古学主题，人们很快发现，Mojang在这片广阔的考古学天地中，仅仅迈出了一小步。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>本模组的目标是改进更新中引入的机制，并扩展我的世界宇宙，让玩家在忠于游戏本质的同时，发现新的内容。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>我们还计划定期将模组更新到新版本，并在未来几周内提供新内容。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2IiWwGYwBPU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>兼容性：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>世界生成</strong> - BA包含通用（c:）生物群系标签，以及以下模组的标签：</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Terralith</span></a><span style=\"color:#008000\">、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-vibrant-journeys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Project: Vibrant Journeys</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-ecosphere\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">William Wythers' Expanded Ecosphere</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/regions-unexplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions Unexplored</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><strong>其他</strong> - 其他杂项兼容性包括：</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\"><a style=\"color:#008000\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-slot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElytraSlot</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment Descriptions</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cristel-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cristel Lib</a></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\">如果您缺少某些兼容性，或者在安装模组后难以找到任何结构，请<a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"https://github.com/Pandarix/BetterArcheology/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">提交问题</a>。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d60c79dc-ea5e-4e57-b18e-11518bc241e7.webp\" alt=\"使用代码 Pandarix 在 Bisecthosting.com 享受 25% 折扣\" width=\"1092\" height=\"182\"></strong></p>",
